      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEROIC FEDERER (1) has an excellent record over this course and distance having never missed the placings in five starts, including three wins and two placings. Was out of the placings last time (28.66) at this track in a NG, finishing sixth and beaten 10 lengths. Makes strong appeal on best. WEFFALEE LEE LEE (2) has a strong record this track and trip including two wins from four starts. Below best last time at Grafton (21.51) in a NG, finishing a 24 length fifth. Looks a key chance on best figures. HARA'S FRANKIE (6) took the sit on the lead from a low draw but levelled up and led around the bend to score (29.64) at Q Parklands in a Grade 5 over 520m. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Bold showing expected again. COUNTRY FORM (7) was well fancied last time on the back of some sparkling form, which included a two-start winning streak, but could only manage fourth (28.19) at this track. Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and a minor placing from four starts.",
